  Entries:
  - content: "Hmm\u2026 I should be able to utilize two weapons in a fight."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 88a7e4552c1afa641acadc54e9b6cbac, type: 3}
    events: []
  - content: I already have my staff with me.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a34c4d771cecc3e40814a015e6e3b31d, type: 3}
    events: []
  - content: "And since I\u2019ve been training hard to use the pistol recently,
      I should bring that to my exam."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
    picture: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 601769b83c413394f9dcef8bf9a4ef38, type: 3}
    events: []
  - content: <i>[Click] on the weapon to select it and bring it into combat.</i>
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e9d3865c367188f4f99c47e692b92911, type: 2}
    sfxId: 0
